module System

# Each declaration below creates nothing: `@rv` names the shared declaration it shows, and validate-stdlib
# checks that the two still match.

### Represents the aggregate protocol for bounded fixed-width integers.
### `FixedIntegral` combines exact integer operators with bitwise behavior and
### the alternate wrapping, clamping, and unchecked arithmetic surfaces expected
### from machine-sized integer types.
@rv("FixedIntegral")
protocol FixedIntegral
obeys Integral, Invertible, WrappingArithmetic, ClampingArithmetic, UncheckedArithmetic,
    UncheckedFloorDivisible
